    "Return BLOCKED on any subject fingerprint, dispatch exclusion, selected handoff, branch/HEAD, or authority mismatch.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if correctness requires broader resolver redesign, a new high-level CRITICAL edit, Cargo/package changes, ambient authority, weakened repository safety, HCM-2.2 reinterpretation, HCM-2.4, or later-phase work; identify the conflict without widening scope.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED on any finding, untested mandatory vector, partial persistence authority, unsafe filesystem access, stale or overbroad classification, manifest omission/self-reference, or unsupported proof claim.",
